# Verifies the tap on the search-result row routed to ClimbDetail
# (not e.g. SetterDetail or a different climb's detail). The NAV
# COMPLETE marker carries the climb's uuid; we don't pin a specific
# uuid here because Kilter catalog uuids change with blob refreshes,
# but the presence of the marker is enough alongside the assertVisible
# of the climb name on the detail screen.
🧭 NAV START: BoardBrowser → ClimbDetail\(
🧭 .*BoardClimbDetailVM\.init start
🧭 .*loadClimb start
🧭 .*loadClimb complete
🧭 .*NAV COMPLETE: BoardClimbDetail\(
